## 3. Call Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TR as Trigger Source
    participant MW as Main Logic App<br/>(Process)
    participant ST as Step Logic App<br/>(Child Workflow)
    participant RW as Reused Logic App<br/>(Service Call)
    participant EXT as External System

    TR->>MW: Start process (payload)
    activate MW
    MW->>MW: Evaluate condition / branch
    MW->>ST: Invoke Workflow (Step 1 inputs)
    activate ST
    ST->>RW: Invoke Workflow (service inputs)
    activate RW
    RW->>EXT: HTTP/REST call
    activate EXT
    EXT-->>RW: Response / fault
    deactivate EXT
    RW-->>ST: Result (success/failure)
    deactivate RW
    ST->>ST: Map response, apply step logic
    ST-->>MW: Step output / status
    deactivate ST
    MW->>MW: Update process state,<br/>evaluate next step
    MW-->>TR: Process response / completion event
    deactivate MW
```

